OL,3,AAt least 17 dead in crush at Hindu
OL,4,Afestival event in India
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 17 people have been killed and
OL,7,Fmany more injured in a crush at an
OL,8,Fevent in the Indian city of Kolkata to
OL,9,Fmark the Hindu festival of Durga Puja,
OL,10,Fofficials say.
OL,12,FThe incident occurred during sudden
OL,13,Frainfall, which witnesses say prompted
OL,14,Fa surge of people to try to seek
OL,15,Fshelter.
OL,17,FWest Bengal's Chief Minister Suvendhu
OL,18,FAdhikari said a seven-year-old girl was
OL,19,Famong the dead, and that 25 people were
OL,20,Fbeing treated for injuries.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
