OL,3,AAt least 17 dead in crush at Hindu
OL,4,Afestival event in India
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndian Prime Minister Narendra Modi
OL,7,Fdescribed it as a "tragic" incident and
OL,8,Fsaid the regional government was
OL,9,Fproviding help to affected families.
